|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Input Parameters       | Flexible configuration for package version, servers, certificates, etc.     |
| Scenario-Based Logic   | Modular handling of different installation and upgrade scenarios.           |
| OS Family Validation   | Ensures compatibility with the target operating system (supports only RedHat). |
| Answer File Generation | Dynamically generates answer files for customized installation.             |
| Secure Communication   | Configures secure or non-secure communication based on certificates.        |
| Package Management     | Installs, removes, or upgrades packages with dependency management.         |
| Service Management     | Manages NetBackup-related services to ensure proper functionality.          |
| Repository Management  | Enables or disables repositories dynamically based on conditions.           |
| Cleanup Tasks          | Removes temporary files and unnecessary packages.                           |
| Error Handling         | Validates input, handles scenarios, and provides meaningful error messages. |
| Logging and Debugging  | Logs installation events and errors for better visibility.                  |
| Modular Design         | Separates installation, service management, and configuration tasks for better maintainability. |

